---
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <h1 class="hero-title">Automate your food business.</h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">
      I help restaurants, cafes, and food stalls in the Philippines streamline orders, manage inventory, and handle customer messaging. Less chaos, more profit.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="/services" class="button primary">See What I Do</a>
      <a href="/about" class="button secondary">Read My Story</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .hero-content {
    max-width: 800px;
  }
  .hero-title {
    font-size: var(--step-4);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    color: var(--ink-2);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    max-width: 65ch;
  }
  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .button {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }
  .button.primary {
    background-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--paper);
    border: 2px solid var(--accent);
  }
  .button.primary:hover {
    background-color: var(--accent-ink);
    border-color: var(--accent-ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .button.secondary {
    background-color: transparent;
    color: var(--ink);
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .button.secondary:hover {
    background-color: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
</style>
